## Selection among task operators: the original makes all move-boat operators
## indifferent (random choice).  Kept as task search control, active only when look-ahead
## planning is off (^flags.look-ahead-planning false), so that no tie impasse arises.
sp {mac*select*task-operator*indifferent
   (state <s> ^problem-space.name mac
              ^flags.look-ahead-planning false
              ^operator <o> +)
   (<o> ^task-operator true)
-->
   (<s> ^operator <o> =)
}
